WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.160
Luke 21

00:02.160 --> 00:07.440
Jesus looked up and saw the rich putting their gifts into the offering box.

00:08.040 --> 00:11.220
And he saw a poor widow put in two small copper coins.

00:11.820 --> 00:12.500
And he said,

00:13.260 --> 00:18.240
Truly I tell you, this poor widow has put in more than all of them,

00:18.960 --> 00:21.560
for they all contributed out of their abundance.

00:22.480 --> 00:26.400
But she out of her poverty put in all she had to live on.

00:26.400 --> 00:28.900
And while some were speaking of the temple,

00:29.320 --> 00:33.240
how it was adorned with noble stones and offerings, he said,

00:34.040 --> 00:35.700
As for these things that you see,

00:36.360 --> 00:40.060
the days will come when there will not be left here one stone upon another

00:40.060 --> 00:41.980
that will not be thrown down.

00:42.740 --> 00:43.780
And they asked him,

00:44.520 --> 00:47.320
Teacher, when will these things be?

00:47.780 --> 00:51.280
And what will be the sign when these things are about to take place?

00:51.720 --> 00:52.840
And he said,

00:53.540 --> 00:55.540
See that you are not led astray.

00:55.540 --> 00:58.080
For many will come in my name, saying,

00:58.600 --> 01:01.720
I am he, and the time is at hand.

01:02.880 --> 01:04.060
Do not go after them.

01:04.640 --> 01:08.400
And when you hear of wars and tumults, do not be terrified,

01:08.980 --> 01:13.420
for these things must first take place, but the end will not be at once.

01:14.160 --> 01:15.260
Then he said to them,

01:16.000 --> 01:20.040
Nation will rise against nation, and kingdom against kingdom.

01:20.040 --> 01:25.340
There will be great earthquakes, and in various places famines and pestilences.

01:25.540 --> 01:28.660
And there will be terrors and great signs from heaven.

01:29.380 --> 01:33.860
But before all this, they will lay their hands on you and persecute you,

01:34.380 --> 01:36.600
delivering you up to the synagogues and prisons,

01:36.920 --> 01:40.720
and you will be brought before kings and governors for my name's sake.

01:41.500 --> 01:44.600
This will be your opportunity to bear witness.

01:46.100 --> 01:50.460
Settle it therefore in your minds, not to meditate beforehand how to answer.

01:51.020 --> 01:53.080
For I will give you a mouth and wisdom,

01:53.080 --> 01:55.520
which none of your adversaries will be able to hear.

01:55.540 --> 01:56.980
You will not be able to withstand or contradict.

01:57.860 --> 02:00.780
You will be delivered up even by parents and brothers,

02:01.140 --> 02:05.100
and relatives and friends, and some of you they will put to death.

02:05.780 --> 02:08.260
You will be hated by all for my name's sake,

02:08.640 --> 02:10.900
but not a hair of your head will perish.

02:11.620 --> 02:14.780
By your endurance you will gain your lives.

02:16.100 --> 02:19.540
But when you see Jerusalem surrounded by armies,

02:19.960 --> 02:22.300
then know that its desolation has come near.

02:22.760 --> 02:25.520
Then let those who are in Judea flee to the mountains,

02:25.540 --> 02:28.540
and let those who are inside the city depart,

02:29.020 --> 02:31.780
and let not those who are out in the country enter it.

02:32.280 --> 02:36.440
For these are days of vengeance to fulfill all that is written.

02:37.780 --> 02:39.680
Alas for women who are pregnant,

02:40.040 --> 02:42.820
and for those who are nursing infants in those days!

02:43.360 --> 02:45.560
For there will be great distress upon the earth,

02:45.740 --> 02:47.440
and wrath against this people.

02:48.040 --> 02:50.080
They will fall by the edge of the sword,

02:50.300 --> 02:52.420
and be led captive among all nations.

02:53.020 --> 02:55.440
And Jerusalem will be trampled underfoot,

02:55.800 --> 02:59.660
by the Gentiles, until the times of the Gentiles are fulfilled.

03:01.020 --> 03:04.420
And there will be signs in sun, and moon, and stars,

03:04.840 --> 03:08.040
and on the earth distress of nations in perplexity,

03:08.400 --> 03:11.300
because of the roaring of the sea and the waves,

03:11.960 --> 03:16.300
people fainting with fear and with foreboding of what is coming on the world.

03:16.900 --> 03:19.360
For the powers of the heavens will be shaken,

03:19.360 --> 03:25.360
and then they will see the Son of Man coming in a cloud with power and great glory,

03:25.540 --> 03:26.380
and then they will see the Son of Man coming in a cloud with power and great glory.

03:26.380 --> 03:28.740
Now when these things begin to take place,

03:29.300 --> 03:31.480
straighten up and raise your heads,

03:31.900 --> 03:34.600
because your redemption is drawing near.

03:35.680 --> 03:37.300
And he told them a parable.

03:37.800 --> 03:40.680
Look at the fig tree and all the trees.

03:41.320 --> 03:42.760
As soon as they come out in leaf,

03:43.280 --> 03:46.560
you see for yourselves and know that the summer is already near.

03:47.140 --> 03:50.180
So also when you see these things taking place,

03:50.760 --> 03:53.080
you know that the kingdom of God is near.

03:53.980 --> 03:55.200
Truly I say to you,

03:55.540 --> 03:59.560
this generation will not pass away until all has taken place.

04:00.240 --> 04:01.780
Heaven and earth will pass away,

04:02.260 --> 04:04.380
but my words will not pass away.

04:05.640 --> 04:06.940
But watch yourselves,

04:07.440 --> 04:10.660
lest your hearts be weighed down with dissipation and drunkenness

04:10.660 --> 04:12.360
and cares of this life,

04:12.800 --> 04:15.760
and that day come upon you suddenly like a trap.

04:16.100 --> 04:19.820
For it will come upon all who dwell on the face of the whole earth.

04:20.360 --> 04:22.460
But stay awake at all times,

04:22.980 --> 04:25.100
praying that you may have strength to escape

04:25.100 --> 04:27.460
all these things that are going to take place,

04:27.880 --> 04:30.520
and to stand before the Son of Man.

04:31.520 --> 04:34.000
And every day he was teaching in the temple,

04:34.380 --> 04:37.980
but at night he went out and lodged on the mount called Olivet.

04:38.580 --> 04:42.800
And early in the morning all the people came to him in the temple to hear him.

